NAME: StopWatch

DESCRIPTION:

Start, stop, and reset a timer.
Record lap times while it runs.

START begins the timer.
STOP pauses it.
RESUME continues from the
paused time.

LAP, while running, saves the
current lap. The list shows
the lap time and the total.
The newest lap is at the top.
The shortest lap is green.
Drag the list to scroll.

RESET, while stopped, clears
the time and the laps.

The large digits are the total.
The LAP line is the time since
the previous lap.

NOTES:

Developed with AI assistance.
